    "text": "<p>Match List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d25a9af9-a4b5-4899-81c1-56eef1eec907-image.png\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 79px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Wurtz reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e8fe2604-80bb-4611-a19e-3d75e4eaad8e-image.png\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 79px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Sandmeyer reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ether</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Fittig reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Na</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ether</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Gatterman reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
